    "body": "Priority change: `P1` to `P3`, by a maintainer decision of 2026-11-17 (question dialog). His answer: \"Only #2350 holds\". A dwell that a post leaves out on G73 or G84 does not hold the v0.23.0 cut. The issue is worked next and is listed under \"Known issues\" if it is open at the cut.\n",
