    "updated_at": "2026-11-17T15:11:13Z",
    "body": "Maintainer decision of 2026-11-17 (question dialog) for the Sinumerik G73 dwell: \"Not verified: leave it\". His check on the 840D in ISO dialect mode (G291) covered G83 only. The ISO dialects Function Manual 07/2021, section 6.3, lists no P word for G73. The post does not write a P on G73 until a source verifies it. The open work for this issue: the post must not leave out the dwell without a message. PR #2353 does not change G73. The `blocked` label is removed: the issue is free for a pick.\n",
